cs/specs/use-cases/rel00.0-uc001-magefiles.yaml (use case covering the magefiles release deliverables)\n      - docs/ARCHITECTURE.yaml (cmd/ component structure and DD7 generation scope)\n      - go.mod (module path for imports)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/version/main.go\n        action: create\n        note: version command entry point -- prints version information per prd011-magefiles\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement cmd/version/main.go per all cmd/version requirements in prd011-magefiles.yaml -- read the PRD first and implement every requirement it specifies for the version command\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Output version information to stdout in the format specified by prd011-magefiles\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Exit with code 0 on successful version output\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Follow existing cmd/ package conventions: package main, single main.go entry point, idiomatic Go with no external dependencies beyond the standard library\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Place implementation in cmd/version/main.go per ARCHITECTURE.yaml cmd/ component structure -- one package per utility\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Use copyright header matching existing project files: Copyright (c) 2026 Petar Djukic. All rights reserved. SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"All implementation details -- variable names, output format, build-time variable injection strategy -- must be derived from prd011-magefiles.yaml, not invented\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"cmd/version/main.go exists and compiles successfully with go build ./cmd/version/\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"Running the compiled binary prints version information to stdout per prd011-magefiles requirements\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"Binary exits with code 0 on success\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"Code passes golangci-lint with no warnings\"\n```"